      "feedback": "自动测试：31/35。\n用例 fill-edge-3，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\n用例 fill-edge-4，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\n用例 fill-edge-5，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\n用例 fill-edge-6，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 fillsToday, valveOpen。\nLTL 检查：not_run。",
      "idx": 0,
      "code": "FUNCTION_BLOCK FB\nVAR_INPUT\n    startBtn   : BOOL;\n    resetBtn   : BOOL;\n    doneSensor : BOOL;\n    targetVol  : REAL;\n    flowVol    : REAL;\nEND_VAR\nVAR_OUTPUT\n    valveOpen  : BOOL;\n    fillsToday : INT;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n    prev_startBtn   : BOOL := FALSE;\n    prev_resetBtn   : BOOL := FALSE;\n    prev_valveOpen  : BOOL := FALSE;\n    currentFillVol  : REAL := 0.0;\n    pendingConfirm  : BOOL := FALSE;\nEND_VAR\n\nVAR\n    risingStart : BOOL;\n    risingReset : BOOL;\nEND_VAR\n\n// 检测上升沿（基于上周期状态）\nrisingStart := startBtn AND NOT prev_startBtn;\nrisingReset := resetBtn  AND NOT prev_resetBtn;\n\n// 复位处理（最高优先级）\nIF risingReset THEN\n    fillsToday      := 0;\n    valveOpen       := FALSE;\n    pendingConfirm  := FALSE;\n    currentFillVol  := 0.0;\nELSE\n    // 非复位时处理\n    \n    // 启动新瓶\n    IF risingStart THEN\n        // 取消上一瓶的待确认（如果有）\n        pendingConfirm := FALSE;\n        // 清零本瓶累计并开阀\n        currentFillVol := 0.0;\n        valveOpen      := TRUE;\n    END_IF;\n\n    // 灌装累计（阀开时）\n    IF valveOpen THEN\n        currentFillVol := currentFillVol + flowVol;\n    END_IF;\n\n    // 达标检测：累计达到或超过目标体积时立即关阀并设待确认\n    IF valveOpen AND currentFillVol >= targetVol THEN\n        valveOpen      := FALSE;\n        pendingConfirm := TRUE;\n    END_IF;\n\n    // 确认检测：待确认且传感器为真时确认并计数\n    IF pendingConfirm AND doneSensor THEN\n        pendingConfirm := FALSE;\n        IF fillsToday < 32767 THEN\n            fillsToday := fillsToday + 1;\n        END_IF;\n    END_IF;\nEND_IF;\n\n// 更新状态变量\nprev_startBtn  := startBtn;\nprev_resetBtn  := resetBtn;\nprev_valveOpen := valveOpen;\n\nEND_FUNCTION_BLOCK",
